# patches/reference.sha256: the script packages the DEFAULT build makes (the sets marked on in sets.txt), from
# the shipped .u (shipped.sha256) and the game folder's per-class inis (the ones the game runs with), with this
# repo's decompiler, patches and ucc. A regression reference (the build is deterministic): scripts-proof P2
# (tools/scripts/uc-patches-proof.sh p2) builds base + default sets and checks every package against it;
# `sha256sum -c` in build-native/Scripts/System checks a build by hand. When a set (or the decompiler, or
# the compiler) changes on purpose, regenerate it and commit it with the change:
#   tools/scripts/uc-patches-proof.sh p2 --write-reference      (patches/README.md, "Changing a script")
